BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Expected] Samsung/Google Android XR glasses preorders open
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTSTAMP:20261109T121402Z
UID:samsung-google-intelligent-eyewear-preorders-2026@headwear-calendar
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Launch
DESCRIPTION:Status: Expected\nType: launch\n\nPreorders for the Samsung an
 d Google Android XR 'Intelligent Eyewear' (designs with Gentle Monster and
  Warby Parker) reportedly open 12 Nov\, with first deliveries in mid-Decem
 ber. The date comes from Warby Parker's co-CEO on its Q3 earnings call and
  from Gentle Monster's website\; Samsung and Google have not confirmed it.
  Korean press reports preorders in Korea\, the US and other major markets.
  No price announced yet.\n\nSources:\n- https://the-gadgeteer.com/2026/11/
 06/samsung-android-xr-glasses-preorders-november-12/\n- https://engadget.c
 om/2309631/googles-eyewear-partners-cant-keep-a-lid-on-its-smart-glasses-p
 lans\n- https://en.sedaily.com/finance/2026/11/09/samsungs-first-ai-glasse
 s-open-for-preorder-on-the-12th\n\nLast checked: 2026-11-09
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T000000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
END:VEVENT
